WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.750
When I first started selling
Manulife &lt;i&gt;Vitality&lt;/i&gt;, 

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:04.333
it was about the rewards.

00:00:04.333 --> 00:00:07.083
And the perfect person was someone

00:00:07.083 --> 00:00:09.750
who was young and active,
and they were going to be

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:12.208
just a win-win in the product fit.

00:00:12.208 --> 00:00:14.291
But it’s actually the complete opposite.

00:00:14.291 --> 00:00:17.333
It’s those clients
that you can have the greatest impact

00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:20.000
on premiums,
who are the older clients.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.541
Those ones that are looking
for the motivation

00:00:22.541 --> 00:00:24.541
for change in their current lifestyle.

00:00:24.625 --> 00:00:27.708
Anyone that is either new to the industry

00:00:27.708 --> 00:00:30.958
or an advisor that hasn’t put
Manulife &lt;i&gt;Vitality&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:30.958 --> 00:00:32.125
in front of their clients,

00:00:32.125 --> 00:00:34.125
my one piece of advice is

00:00:34.125 --> 00:00:35.333
buy it for yourself.

00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:38.250
Be an advocate of Manulife &lt;i&gt;Vitality&lt;/i&gt;.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:39.291
Understand it yourself

00:00:39.291 --> 00:00:41.916
so you, as an advisor, are equipped

00:00:41.916 --> 00:00:43.916
to have that conversation
with your clients 

00:00:43.916 --> 00:00:45.041
and understand how it works.

